    "notes": {
        "4c2d5a7e-7b21-4cbb-b55e-4afa4bafaad2": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 416,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 192,
            "content": "## Test data assumption\n\n`blank` in **Set Variables** is intentionally an empty string (used by the `empty` / `notEmpty` clauses). `count` is 12 and `title` is `Appmixer E2E condition` - the clause values depend on them.\n\nEvery clause sets an operator: since issue #2902 a clause without one is rejected by the Condition schema. If a Condition is routed to the wrong port, its Assert never fires and **After All** fails on timeout."
        }
    }
